# Project: Car Service Bot — «Ампер» (Taganrog)

Two bots, one codebase:
- **`src/`** — Telegram bot (Telegraf 4.x)
- **`src-max/`** — Max messenger bot (@maxhub/max-bot-api)

Both bots share the same folder structure: `api/`, `buttons/`, `commands/`, `config/`, `jobs/`, `lib/`, `middlewares/`, `services/`, `text/`.

## Business logic

- Warranty ТО reminders: 90-day cycles, alerts at 20 and 10 days before next service
- Battery selection wizard (Max only; TG redirects to Max bot + website)
- Admin broadcasts scheduled for 09:00 or 17:00 MSK
- Admin commands: `/w` (warranty), `/nb` (new broadcast), `/b` (list broadcasts), `/u` (user count)

## Supabase

- Telegram bot uses `SUPABASE_*` env vars
- Max bot uses `MAX_SUPABASE_*` + also writes battery requests to TG Supabase (`SUPABASE_*`) with `source: 'max'`

## Cron

Two daily runs: `0 6 * * *` and `0 14 * * *` — cleanup old broadcast messages, send broadcasts, send warranty reminders.

## Admin notifications

TG bot sends errors/alerts to Max admins (`MAX_ADMIN_IDS`) via Max API. Max bot notifies its own Max admins.

## Key rule

When editing `src/` logic, check if `src-max/` needs the same change and vice versa. They are mirrors with different framework APIs.
